  "content": "<blockquote>\r\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/mx3ysk4vmo4piq5jesiwo/LOGOKNM.png?rlkey=2ghhnnbtyu5z1q3mdi8qyou6a&dl=1\" width=\"1125\" height=\"528\"></p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/1.20.1 -msg?style=for-the-badge&label=Minecraft Version&color=0096f0&cacheSeconds=https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib&link=https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" alt=\"Static Badge\" width=\"175\" height=\"22\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Fabric -msg?style=for-the-badge&label=Modloader&color=0096f0&cacheSeconds=https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib&link=https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" alt=\"Static Badge\" width=\"150\" height=\"22\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spell-engine\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/REQUIRED -msg?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&label=Spell Engine&color=0096f0&cacheSeconds=https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib&link=https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" alt=\"Static Badge\" width=\"176\" height=\"22\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/azurelib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/REQUIRED -msg?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&label=Azurelib&color=0096f0&cacheSeconds=https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib&link=https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" alt=\"Static Badge\" width=\"157\" height=\"22\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/28E3kQk7RD\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CLICK -msg?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&label=Discord&color=0096f0&cacheSeconds=https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib&link=https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" alt=\"Static Badge\" width=\"128\" height=\"22\"></a>&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h1><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><img src=\"https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/f7sgsuqb497xm08h473it/Installation_klein_knm.png?rlkey=1e5t54j1timeo0fd79lfmfzg2&dl=1\" width=\"1125\" height=\"94\"></span></h1>\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Epic Knights'n'Mages Fabric — это официальный порт аналога Forge. Поскольку Ars Nouveau не имеет версии Fabric, этот мод совместим с Spell Engine. Он добавляет в игру бронемашины и оружие в 3D-стиле. Броня вдохновлена известными RPG-играми.</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><em><strong>Примечание: этот мод все еще находится в разработке, поэтому он может содержать ошибки и вызывать сбои.</strong></em></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>Совместимость с:</strong></h4>\r\n<ul style=\"text-align:left\">\r\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wizards rel=nofollow\" Wizards</a></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spellblade-next rel=nofollow\" Spellblades and Such</a></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">Заметка: Вам нужны Wizards или Spellblades and Such. Epic Knights'n'Mages в настоящее время не имеет собственных заклинаний!</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><em><strong>Присоединяйтесь к нашему сообществу Discord! </strong></em><strong>Посмотрите на</strong><em><strong> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/4A9SEahH4U\" rel=\"nofollow\">PixelDreamStudios</a> — </strong></em><strong>официального партнера!</strong></p>\r\n<p><em><strong>Личный дискорд автора — <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.vpixel.studio%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">нажмите здесь</a></strong></em></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fPixelDream\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/qbmdpbq5yc5x8o45a5q8n/BH_NU_PROMO.png?rlkey=96ehoczxgelxdzyy1qwgnc81h&st=qf18dmd1&dl=1\" width=\"550\" height=\"120\"></strong></em></a></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/j3w3vk5dm1ttmfqp8exwy/credits_klein_knm.png?rlkey=37hxqgwm9w0utpqmlno2lovpd&dl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"47\"></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><em>Damienbrittan&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fde.fiverr.com%252fdamienbrittan\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://de.fiverr.com/damienbrittan</a> за замечательный логотип</em></strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/ye0f3l3yhxi7x99zou5u9/goals_klein.png?rlkey=20jtlhq177h3cx23uk93dral3&dl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"47\"></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>✔️ 500 скачиваний</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>✔️ 1.000 скачиваний</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>✔️ 2.000 скачиваний</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>✔️ 5.000 скачиваний</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align:ce